    wt "Ho costruito un dispositivo in grado di inviare messaggi tra i mondi."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:220
translate italian loveinterestmontage_b6a5943b:

    # pc "Just while I was gone? That was quick."
    pc "Proprio mentre ero via? È stato veloce."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:221
translate italian loveinterestmontage_c5e0562a:

    # wt "I was motivated."
    wt "Ero motivato."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:224
translate italian loveinterestmontage_ccb1fefb:

    # pc "So, I could talk to my dad? Or anyone else that I met there?"
    pc "Quindi potrei parlare con mio padre? O con chiunque altro abbia incontrato lì?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:225
translate italian loveinterestmontage_85724e3f:

    # wt "Theoretically. They don't have any way to speak back though. Yet."
    wt "In teoria sì. Però loro non hanno modo di risponderti. Almeno per ora."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:226
translate italian loveinterestmontage_b0652138:

    # wt "Is that something that you'd want to do?"
    wt "È qualcosa che vorresti fare?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:227
translate italian loveinterestmontage_5b22d737:

    # pc "Maybe."
    pc "Forse."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:230
translate italian loveinterestmontage_b67e5d2c:

    # wt "I'm not sure why you lost so much time during the return trip."
    wt "Non capisco bene perché tu abbia perso così tanto tempo durante il viaggio di ritorno."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:231
translate italian loveinterestmontage_4a7e2d03:

    # wt "It seems like time moves faster over there, so less time should have passed here."
    wt "Sembra che il tempo scorra più velocemente laggiù, quindi qui avrebbe dovuto passare meno tempo."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:232
translate italian loveinterestmontage_f52c90f3:

    # wt "But you had that beard when you came back and a month passed while you were gone."
    wt "Ma avevi quella barba quando sei tornato ed è passato un mese mentre eri via."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:235
translate italian loveinterestmontage_522730c7:

    # wt "More studies will have to be done."
    wt "Bisognerà fare ulteriori studi."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:236
translate italian loveinterestmontage_7dc54a4b:

    # wt "Can I count on you to help me with them? I'd love to hire you, now that you're almost done with school."
    wt "Posso contare sul tuo aiuto? Mi piacerebbe assumerti, ora che hai quasi finito gli studi."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:237
translate italian loveinterestmontage_39c52a0e:

    # wt "I believe graduation is this weekend?"
    wt "Credo che la laurea sia questo fine settimana?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:240
translate italian loveinterestmontage_38559d3f:

    # pc "Graduation!"
    pc "La laurea!"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:241
translate italian loveinterestmontage_ac2fc58a:

    # pc "Fuck..."
    pc "Cazzo..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:245
translate italian loveinterestmontage_05caf076:

    # et "You missed some assignments and the final..."
    et "Hai saltato alcuni compiti e l’esame finale..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:247
translate italian loveinterestmontage_b3be8a82:

    # et "... but don't worry, honey, I took care of it for you."
    et "... ma non preoccuparti, tesoro, ci ho pensato io per te."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:248
translate italian loveinterestmontage_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:251
translate italian loveinterestmontage_962b180d:

    # et "Of course. You're a smart boy. I know you would have done well on them."
    et "Certo. Sei un ragazzo intelligente. So che avresti ottenuto ottimi risultati."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:252
translate italian loveinterestmontage_486294f6:

    # et "I'm not going to stop you from graduating because you had something more important going on in your life for a while."
    et "Non ti impedirò di laurearti solo perché per un po’ hai avuto cose più importanti da fare nella tua vita."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:255
translate italian loveinterestmontage_08a658e1:

    # et "Besides... I take care of you and I know you'll take care of me later."
    et "E poi... io mi prendo cura di te e so che più avanti tu ti prenderai cura di me."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:256
translate italian loveinterestmontage_e4d26afc:

    # et "Right?"
    et "Giusto?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:257
translate italian loveinterestmontage_78bd7358:

    # pc "Damn right."
    pc "Certo che sì."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:259
translate italian loveinterestmontage_dd7b6f24:

    # et "... but if you sit and take the final real quick and you pass, you'll still be able to graduate."
    et "... ma se ti siedi e sostieni l’esame finale in un batter d’occhio e lo superi, potrai comunque laurearti."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:260
translate italian loveinterestmontage_e9e45599:

    # pc "Oh yes please, Mrs. McGee. That would be great."
    pc "Oh sì, per favore, signora McGee. Sarebbe fantastico."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:266
translate italian loveinterestmontage_d0ae05fb:

    # et "This is very good. You'll pass."
    et "Va molto bene. Lo supererai."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:267
translate italian loveinterestmontage_b6c4c749:

    # et "I knew you were a smart boy."
    et "Sapevo che eri un ragazzo intelligente."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:268
translate italian loveinterestmontage_6f49be4e:

    # pc "Thanks so much, Mrs. McGee."
    pc "Grazie mille, signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:272
translate italian loveinterestmontage_d08e2cf8:

    # sst "Yeah, you missed a few things..."
    sst "Sì, hai sbagliato alcune cose..."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:274
translate italian loveinterestmontage_322a44f2:

    # sst "...but I'm not going to fail you."
    sst "...ma non ti boccerò."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:277
translate italian loveinterestmontage_97e19796:

    # sst "I need you to graduate so that I feel less guilty about fucking you every chance I get."
    sst "Ho bisogno che tu ti diplomi, così mi sentirò meno in colpa quando ti scopo ogni volta che ne ho l’occasione."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:278
translate italian loveinterestmontage_dc418b49:

    # pc "Really? So I'm good?"
    pc "Davvero? Quindi vado bene?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:281
translate italian loveinterestmontage_8e879040:

    # sst "You might have to do some private studies... but yeah, you're so good, baby."
    sst "Potresti dover studiare un po’ per conto tuo... ma sì, vai benissimo, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:283
translate italian loveinterestmontage_cc1fc6d9:

    # sst "... but I hate failing people, especially when I can tell that they're trying."
    sst "... ma odio bocciare le persone, specialmente quando vedo che ci stanno provando."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:284
translate italian loveinterestmontage_d70fddc8:

    # sst "So you're good. You'll pass."
    sst "Quindi vai bene. Supererai l’esame."

# game/Scenes/Update20/loveinterestmontage.rpy:285
translate italian loveinterestmontage_3484a643:

    # pc "Thanks so much, Ms. Welch."
    pc "Grazie mille, signora Welch."

